        "description": "Creating a task returns only a canonical graph identifier. Callers construct app URLs manually, which can select the wrong channel; a new browser tab cannot reuse the existing authenticated app session. Expected: tool read/create results supply canonical identity plus an app-owned credential-free browser link that opens the exact node in an authenticated browser. Never embed app or MCP bearer credentials in tool output.",
